  "description": "He accurately predicted the 2000 and 2008 crashes. Is he right again?",
  "body_html": "<p>Quick Market Update Today. If you didn’t see <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/top-stock-has-the-best-vcp-ive-seen?r=4z8lgl\">Yesterday’s post</a> with some top stocks in there. Blackberry was called out, and it rocketed over +20% just today! The #1 pick in the bunch still looks fantastic for more runway upwards, so check that out when you have time. </p><p>I’ve been tagged several times for Jeremy Grantham’s commentary from “The Diary of a CEO.” Watch the video above, its why I make them. My thoughts are there. </p><p>If you are looking for the article: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/brief-stock-market-update-when-to?r=4z8lgl\">When to Sell</a>, there you go. Long story short, I want to see a sector, or a reputable name stock, “snap.”</p><p>Not much to say today. S&amp;P 500 is oscillating around annoying. A few of our positions continued pushing upwards. I am still incredibly bullish on regional banks, one that I own has pushed up past +30% today. You can check out my positions, and the screened stocks at the <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok Summary</a></p><p>Oh, and if you like this content, please like ❤️ and re-stack. </p><p>Have a great day and thanks for stopping by! 👍 </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p>",
